#: crates/typewhisper/src/terminals.rs
msgid "TypeWhisper pastes dictations into terminal apps with Ctrl+Shift+V, because terminals pass Ctrl+V on to the program running in them. GNOME Terminal, Ptyxis, Console, Konsole, Alacritty, kitty, WezTerm, foot, Ghostty and other well-known terminals are always included. Add another terminal if dictating into it pastes nothing."
msgstr "终端会把 Ctrl+V 传给其中运行的程序，因此 TypeWhisper 使用 Ctrl+Shift+V 将听写内容粘贴到终端应用中。GNOME Terminal、Ptyxis、Console、Konsole、Alacritty、kitty、WezTerm、foot、Ghostty 等常见终端始终包含在内。如果在某个终端中听写后没有粘贴任何内容，请添加该终端。"

